    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "To display the right half of the big picture, you set up a vertical blanking routine to start the bit-plane pointers at location START+40 rather than START with the modulo remaining at 40. The data layout is shown in Figures 3-17 and 3-18.",
