    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "Now, the bit-plane pointers contain the value START+80. The modulo (40) is added to the pointers so that when they begin the data fetch for the second line, the correct data is fetched.",
